OL,3,GNEWSAFormer warehouse doubles up as
OL,4,Afilm and TV set
OL,5,
OL,6,FTucked away in a corner of Bradford a
OL,7,Fformer wool warehouse has become a
OL,8,Fgo-to location for film and TV,
OL,9,Fdoubling as everything from a post-war
OL,10,Fboxing ring to a modern-day police
OL,11,Fstation.
OL,13,FBlink and you would miss it.
OL,15,FAside from the city's coroner's court,
OL,16,Fthere is little reason to visit Cater
OL,17,FStreet, nestled away in Bradford's
OL,18,FLittle Germany.
OL,20,FBut, like many of the streets which
OL,21,Fmake up this area, the buildings here
OL,22,Fare a nod to its industrial past.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
